{"version":1,"content":"<p>前港區人大代表吳康民今日（18日）早上逝世，終年100歲。</p><p>特首李家超對吳康民辭世表示哀悼，並向他的家人致以深切慰問。</p><p>前特首梁振英則在社交網站貼出「沉痛哀悼吳康民校長」的字句。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T10:18:52.007891+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:28:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T02:37:33.850853+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T10:17:33.570125+00:00","content_hash":"6d24307e37d8a494cc75cbe5f2a19eaebe158df1da698a8373a2190460ec204f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}